{"meta":{"seed":n:40b0920000000000,"ticksRequested":n:4105180000000000,"founders":null,"engine":s:"emergence-engine.js","engineVersion":s:"2.6.0",},"events":[{"id":n:0000000000000000,"tick":n:0000000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"start","txt":s:"🌍 Four humans wake in an untouched world: <b>Eira</b>, <b>Ask</b>, <b>Embla</b>, <b>Torv</b>. They know nothing — but they can observe everything. What will they create?",},{"id":n:3ff0000000000000,"tick":n:401c000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📖 <b>Eira</b> told the day back as a story worth remembering — <b>Eira's oral saga</b> (Storytelling) has been invented! <i>The first culture — memory shaped into meaning.</i>","tech":s:"storytelling","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4049800000000000,"y":n:4040800000000000,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4000000000000000,"tick":n:401c000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Eira</b> began believing the world repeats and can be understood — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(The Knowing Eye)</i>","custom":s:"c1","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4049800000000000,"y":n:4040800000000000,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:4008000000000000,"tick":n:4030000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Eira</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404a708121291063,"y":n:4042090ebe1acb28,},{"id":n:4010000000000000,"tick":n:4030000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:40494e79877b3f04,"y":n:4042fc388b76bafc,},{"id":n:4014000000000000,"tick":n:403a000000000000,"day":n:4000000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪢 <b>Torv</b> twisted grass fibers into something strong — <b>Torv's braid</b> (Rope) has been invented! <i>Makes it possible to bind parts together.</i>","tech":s:"rope","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404a53dfcbd25ff0,"y":n:4042806b77cca687,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4018000000000000,"tick":n:4051000000000000,"day":n:4010000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧶 <b>Torv</b> crossed threads over threads until cloth grew on the frame — <b>Torv's warp-craft</b> (Weaving) has been invented! <i>Cloth for warmth and trade — and hands that specialize.</i>","tech":s:"weaving","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404b514fbb6350b6,"y":n:4040dda7b2405fb7,"causes":[s:"ev:5",],},{"id":n:401c000000000000,"tick":n:4051000000000000,"day":n:4010000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Torv</b> began carving a sign into a flat stone when something new is made — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Carving a sign into a flat stone)</i>","custom":s:"c2","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404b514fbb6350b6,"y":n:4040dda7b2405fb7,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4020000000000000,"tick":n:4051400000000000,"day":n:4010000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that a struck string and a hollow log ring with a voice. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"soundsRing","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404b514fbb6350b6,"y":n:4040dda7b2405fb7,},{"id":n:4022000000000000,"tick":n:4052000000000000,"day":n:4010000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ask</b> noticed that a bent branch fights to spring back. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"branchBends","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:4047d3bd9c8db57d,"y":n:4042c2edf07cb239,},{"id":n:4024000000000000,"tick":n:4055c00000000000,"day":n:4010000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404bfbb94ff7e048,"y":n:4040c37f9add3fa7,},{"id":n:4026000000000000,"tick":n:405d000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ The first winter has come. The world turns white and hard, and the nights grow long. Fire is no longer comfort — it is life.",},{"id":n:4028000000000000,"tick":n:4060c00000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Embla</b> and <b>Ask</b> have had a child, <b>Liv</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:40466919dc081dc6,"y":n:4044257733d64c4d,"causes":[s:"agent:3",s:"agent:2",],},{"id":n:402a000000000000,"tick":n:4062000000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:402c000000000000,"tick":n:4067c00000000000,"day":n:4022000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔥 <b>Eira</b> rubbed sticks together until a spark caught the tinder — <b>Eira's ember</b> (Fire) has been invented! <i>Warmth at night. Opens the path to pottery and smithing.</i>","tech":s:"fire","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404adf0860371fa2,"y":n:403b31a5df116c99,"causes":[],},{"id":n:402e000000000000,"tick":n:4067c00000000000,"day":n:4022000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Eira</b> was known as <b>Eira the Firebringer</b>.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404adf0860371fa2,"y":n:403b31a5df116c99,},{"id":n:4030000000000000,"tick":n:406aa00000000000,"day":n:4024000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:4031000000000000,"tick":n:406ca00000000000,"day":n:4024000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv</b> and <b>Eira</b> have had a child, <b>Sten</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404b1d6382fb6d43,"y":n:404385c12f3db0f3,"causes":[s:"agent:4",s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:4032000000000000,"tick":n:406e600000000000,"day":n:4026000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that grass fibers hold when twisted. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fibersTwist","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404bbb455e521895,"y":n:4040fca2c60f6a0e,},{"id":n:4033000000000000,"tick":n:4070400000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4034000000000000,"tick":n:4070600000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that spilled seeds sprout where they fall. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"seedsSprout","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404e219f3c9e9975,"y":n:403bd0b52fde5b06,},{"id":n:4035000000000000,"tick":n:4072000000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4036000000000000,"tick":n:4074600000000000,"day":n:402c000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that the stars and seasons turn on a fixed wheel. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"starsWheel","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404c298724e8f727,"y":n:404506f770066515,},{"id":n:4037000000000000,"tick":n:4077800000000000,"day":n:4030000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ask</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404bbef8a820d2de,"y":n:4041218aeaa2dc0d,},{"id":n:4038000000000000,"tick":n:4079400000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4039000000000000,"tick":n:407a800000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Torv</b> began believing a great herd walks the night sky, and the living must follow its path — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(the Sky-Wheel)</i>","custom":s:"c3","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404c10a8c3b3737a,"y":n:40450532b7cbd039,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:403a000000000000,"tick":n:407a800000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 <b>Torv</b> saw a pattern in the stars and gave it a name — <b>the Sky-Wheel</b>. From watching, a cosmology is born: the first faith of the sky.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"label":s:"A RELIGION OF THE SKY",},{"id":n:403b000000000000,"tick":n:407e600000000000,"day":n:4035000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Eira the Firebringer</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404dbd1e6b101285,"y":n:4042ebedd2a03597,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:403c000000000000,"tick":n:4081100000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that fish gather in the shallows. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fishGather","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404bf28ba5fb7023,"y":n:404536f2f656b141,},{"id":n:403d000000000000,"tick":n:4081200000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:403e000000000000,"tick":n:4081780000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Torv</b> let a twisted line sink where the fish gather — <b>Torv's the net</b> (Fishing) has been invented! <i>The water becomes a larder — food even when the land gives little.</i>","tech":s:"fishing","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404c22836cfea356,"y":n:40452aa6391fe474,"causes":[s:"ev:5",],},{"id":n:403f000000000000,"tick":n:4082f80000000000,"day":n:403a000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Eira's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4040000000000000,"tick":n:4085a00000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4040800000000000,"tick":n:4085f80000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"imitated","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> has begun carving a sign into a flat stone when something new is made, the way Torv does. The custom spreads.","custom":s:"c2",},{"id":n:4041000000000000,"tick":n:408a200000000000,"day":n:4042000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4041800000000000,"tick":n:408ea00000000000,"day":n:4045000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4042000000000000,"tick":n:408f800000000000,"day":n:4045800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4042800000000000,"tick":n:4090780000000000,"day":n:4046800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎵 <b>Torv</b> found that a struck string and a voice could ring together — <b>Torv's melody</b> (Music) has been invented! <i>Song at the fire — the root of every art to come.</i>","tech":s:"song","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404bb2ce9ea9afe1,"y":n:4044deab5441451b,"causes":[s:"ev:1",],},{"id":n:4043000000000000,"tick":n:4090c40000000000,"day":n:4046800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔪 <b>Ask</b> struck two stones together and kept the sharp shard — <b>Ask's edge</b> (Sharpened stone) has been invented! <i>Faster gathering of everything.</i>","tech":s:"sharp","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404b2083687d5901,"y":n:4043daa0e5ed0b33,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4043800000000000,"tick":n:4091240000000000,"day":n:4047000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🗡️ <b>Ask</b> lashed a sharp point to a long shaft — <b>Ask's pike</b> (Spear) has been invented! <i>Humans are prey no longer. Deer can be hunted — food even in winter.</i>","tech":s:"spear","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404b19b1d9d898c8,"y":n:4043f96d49211052,"causes":[s:"ev:38",s:"ev:5",],},{"id":n:4044000000000000,"tick":n:4091240000000000,"day":n:4047000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Ask</b> was known as <b>Ask the Spearmaker</b>.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404b19b1d9d898c8,"y":n:4043f96d49211052,},{"id":n:4044800000000000,"tick":n:4091780000000000,"day":n:4047800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪓 <b>Ask</b> bound a hard edge to a wooden shaft — <b>Ask's hewer</b> (Axe) has been invented! <i>Twice as fast logging. Required to build huts.</i>","tech":s:"axe","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404b9947cc2af9a7,"y":n:40439171f61ce51c,"causes":[s:"ev:38",s:"ev:5",],},{"id":n:4045000000000000,"tick":n:4091900000000000,"day":n:4048000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4045800000000000,"tick":n:4092000000000000,"day":n:4048800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4046000000000000,"tick":n:4092480000000000,"day":n:4049000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏹 <b>Ask</b> bent a young branch with a cord and felt it fight back — <b>Ask's hunting bow</b> (Bow) has been invented! <i>The hunt no longer needs closeness. Deer fall at a distance.</i>","tech":s:"bow","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404bdefa6ab0713e,"y":n:404339aa503537aa,"causes":[s:"ev:39",s:"ev:5",],},{"id":n:4046800000000000,"tick":n:4092540000000000,"day":n:4049000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Torv's melody. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:4047000000000000,"tick":n:4093d00000000000,"day":n:404b000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4047800000000000,"tick":n:40960c0000000000,"day":n:404e000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ask</b> raised logs against each other into a shelter — <b>Ask's shelter</b> (Hut) has been invented! <i>Shelter and warmth at night. Three huts close together become a village.</i>","tech":s:"hut","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404ed3c3f9d41bcf,"y":n:40415e9272109e23,"causes":[s:"ev:41",],},{"id":n:4048000000000000,"tick":n:4096100000000000,"day":n:404e000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4048800000000000,"tick":n:4096500000000000,"day":n:404e000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ask</b> built a hut.","x":n:404df99f6935c918,"y":n:40415c79d3dac530,},{"id":n:4049000000000000,"tick":n:4096800000000000,"day":n:404e800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4049800000000000,"tick":n:40971c0000000000,"day":n:404f000000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Torv</b> built a hut.","x":n:404ed0999f9591ea,"y":n:4040fa7b66f43eec,},{"id":n:404a000000000000,"tick":n:4097d00000000000,"day":n:4050000000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛞 <b>Torv</b> watched a log roll and understood something great — <b>Torv's cartwheel</b> (The Wheel) has been invented! <i>The foundation of mills, carts — and everything that spins.</i>","tech":s:"wheel","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:40501bb358b8757c,"y":n:40414dc8bcceda9d,"causes":[s:"ev:41",],},{"id":n:404a800000000000,"tick":n:40984c0000000000,"day":n:4050800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Ask</b> and <b>Torv</b> have had a child, <b>Ylva</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404da28ee6a59892,"y":n:403f312f081e1d2e,"causes":[s:"agent:2",s:"agent:4",],},{"id":n:404b000000000000,"tick":n:4098500000000000,"day":n:4050800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:404b800000000000,"tick":n:4098d40000000000,"day":n:4050c00000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> tried something with wood and fiber — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:404c000000000000,"tick":n:4098e80000000000,"day":n:4050c00000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⛵ <b>Torv</b> stretched cloth on a hull and let the wind do the work — <b>Torv's river-craft</b> (Sailing) has been invented! <i>Rivers and coasts become roads — trade and migration by water.</i>","tech":s:"sailing","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404e6192c4654a3d,"y":n:40409c7bf9303d86,"causes":[s:"ev:6",s:"ev:41",],},{"id":n:404c800000000000,"tick":n:4099840000000000,"day":n:4051400000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Torv's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:404d000000000000,"tick":n:409a080000000000,"day":n:4051800000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that crushed coloured earth stains a lasting mark. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"pigmentStains","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404e391ac07e5a4e,"y":n:40419bcf98777b54,},{"id":n:404d800000000000,"tick":n:409a8c0000000000,"day":n:4052000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Torv</b> placed shaped clay in the fire and found it hard as stone — <b>Torv's jar</b> (Pottery) has been invented! <i>Food can be stored — hunger bites less.</i>","tech":s:"pottery","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404e6229c6448d82,"y":n:40420f23d4daae87,"causes":[s:"ev:14",],},{"id":n:404e000000000000,"tick":n:409a900000000000,"day":n:4052000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:404e800000000000,"tick":n:409aac0000000000,"day":n:4052000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that stones leant just so hold up more than their own weight. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"archStands","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404d11a89ac4285a,"y":n:40425de7d94ab18d,},{"id":n:404f000000000000,"tick":n:409af00000000000,"day":n:4052400000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that marks pressed in clay remain. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"marksRemain","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404dc07ca26edd92,"y":n:4041db273d3096ee,},{"id":n:404f800000000000,"tick":n:409b180000000000,"day":n:4052400000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Eira's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4050000000000000,"tick":n:409b440000000000,"day":n:4052400000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Torv's jar. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:4050400000000000,"tick":n:409b900000000000,"day":n:4052800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Torv</b> built a stone chamber that gathered the heat of the fire — <b>Torv's furnace</b> (Kiln) has been invented! <i>Heat enough to melt what hides in ore and sand.</i>","tech":s:"kiln","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404e0f3fc8b143f8,"y":n:404104501ea2fd54,"causes":[s:"ev:14",s:"ev:59",],},{"id":n:4050800000000000,"tick":n:409ba80000000000,"day":n:4052c00000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Torv's river-craft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sailing",},{"id":n:4050c00000000000,"tick":n:409bc80000000000,"day":n:4052c00000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Torv</b> pressed spilled seeds into turned soil and waited — <b>Torv's tilling</b> (Farming) has been invented! <i>Food that returns every year. The village roots itself.</i>","tech":s:"farming","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404e4d7336a6ad2d,"y":n:40418fd1000f208d,"causes":[s:"ev:59",],},{"id":n:4051000000000000,"tick":n:409be40000000000,"day":n:4052c00000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📜 <b>Torv</b> carved signs into clay so knowledge could outlive its owner — <b>Torv's memory-marks</b> (Writing) has been invented! <i>Knowledge spreads to all — and to generations to come.</i>","tech":s:"writing","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404e4d7336a6ad2d,"y":n:40418fd1000f208d,"causes":[s:"ev:59",],},{"id":n:4051400000000000,"tick":n:409be40000000000,"day":n:4052c00000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Torv</b> was known as <b>Torv the Rememberer</b>.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404e4d7336a6ad2d,"y":n:40418fd1000f208d,},{"id":n:4051800000000000,"tick":n:409c0c0000000000,"day":n:4053000000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Torv the Rememberer</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4010000000000000,},{"id":n:4051c00000000000,"tick":n:409c5c0000000000,"day":n:4053000000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Torv</b> fired shaped clay into blocks that stack true — <b>Torv's mudbrick</b> (Brick) has been invented! <i>Walls that outlast weather — the start of building.</i>","tech":s:"brick","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:40501790160bf135,"y":n:40416714a86c2222,"causes":[s:"ev:59",s:"ev:65",],},{"id":n:4052000000000000,"tick":n:409cd00000000000,"day":n:4053800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4052400000000000,"tick":n:409d600000000000,"day":n:4053c00000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Torv the Rememberer</b> has turned the soil — the valley's first field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404f000000000000,"y":n:4041800000000000,},{"id":n:4052800000000000,"tick":n:409d840000000000,"day":n:4053c00000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404c56e029cf3f99,"y":n:4046179814879309,},{"id":n:4052c00000000000,"tick":n:409e780000000000,"day":n:4054800000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Ask's shelter. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:4053000000000000,"tick":n:409e8c0000000000,"day":n:4054800000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Torv's cartwheel. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"wheel",},{"id":n:4053400000000000,"tick":n:409ef40000000000,"day":n:4054c00000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Ask's hewer. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:4053800000000000,"tick":n:409f000000000000,"day":n:4054c00000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4014000000000000,},{"id":n:4053c00000000000,"tick":n:409f100000000000,"day":n:4055000000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:4054000000000000,"tick":n:409f5c0000000000,"day":n:4055000000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Sten</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404f1a88f43f067e,"y":n:40426a389dde2efb,},{"id":n:4054400000000000,"tick":n:40a0a80000000000,"day":n:4056800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4054800000000000,"tick":n:40a1060000000000,"day":n:4057000000000000,"year":n:4030000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🕳️ <b>Torv</b> lined a deep pit with stone to hold clean water — <b>Torv's cistern</b> (Well) has been invented! <i>Water without walking to the river — a village can grow inland.</i>","tech":s:"well","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404b83ed7e6b15e9,"y":n:4042df2ce053360f,"causes":[s:"ev:71",],},{"id":n:4054c00000000000,"tick":n:40a1380000000000,"day":n:4057400000000000,"year":n:4030000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Ask's pike. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:4055000000000000,"tick":n:40a13c0000000000,"day":n:4057400000000000,"year":n:4030000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏚️ <b>Torv</b> built a dry raised store so the harvest kept till spring — <b>Torv's store-house</b> (Granary) has been invented! <i>Surplus survives winter — the first true wealth.</i>","tech":s:"granary","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404bb2829cc04d43,"y":n:4042a573fde00213,"causes":[s:"ev:67",s:"ev:59",],},{"id":n:4055400000000000,"tick":n:40a1c80000000000,"day":n:4058000000000000,"year":n:4030000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4055800000000000,"tick":n:40a2020000000000,"day":n:4058400000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ylva</b> noticed that certain leaves ease pain and close a wound. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"herbsHeal","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404dfad7d75a25dc,"y":n:403b5a86d1c41f50,},{"id":n:4055c00000000000,"tick":n:40a23c0000000000,"day":n:4058800000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Sten</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404db92167269d94,"y":n:404301800060c7da,},{"id":n:4056000000000000,"tick":n:40a2e80000000000,"day":n:4059800000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4056400000000000,"tick":n:40a3740000000000,"day":n:405a400000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Sten</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4056800000000000,"tick":n:40a3a00000000000,"day":n:405a400000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚪ <b>Torv</b> smelted a pale metal too soft to be worth much alone — <b>Torv's tinwork</b> (Tin) has been invented! <i>Useless alone — everything when married to copper.</i>","tech":s:"tin","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:4053cdb800d71fb5,"y":n:40448463df782bf5,"causes":[s:"ev:65",],},{"id":n:4056c00000000000,"tick":n:40a3c40000000000,"day":n:405a800000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> tried something with clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:4057000000000000,"tick":n:40a3f80000000000,"day":n:405ac00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Liv</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404aa14e179ae78d,"y":n:4048566410aa7134,},{"id":n:4057400000000000,"tick":n:40a4080000000000,"day":n:405b000000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4057800000000000,"tick":n:40a4100000000000,"day":n:405b000000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> tried something with clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:4057c00000000000,"tick":n:40a4420000000000,"day":n:405b400000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Sten</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404d885ad9f87180,"y":n:404321237075cccf,},{"id":n:4058000000000000,"tick":n:40a4600000000000,"day":n:405b400000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Sten</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404d000000000000,"y":n:4042800000000000,},{"id":n:4058400000000000,"tick":n:40a4c80000000000,"day":n:405c000000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Sten</b> and <b>Torv</b> have had a child, <b>Bjorn</b> — generation 3. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:404d45cdba449a79,"y":n:4042d6adbcf49d04,"causes":[s:"agent:6",s:"agent:4",],},{"id":n:4058800000000000,"tick":n:40a5280000000000,"day":n:405c800000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4058c00000000000,"tick":n:40a5360000000000,"day":n:405c800000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Liv</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Saga</b> — generation 3. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404c0119b09f1354,"y":n:40460d4a20aa11ea,"causes":[s:"agent:5",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4059000000000000,"tick":n:40a55e0000000000,"day":n:405cc00000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"sharing","txt":s:"🍞 <b>Sten</b> shared food with <b>Torv</b>. Those who keep the same ways do not let each other starve.","x":n:404d719a512fecad,"y":n:40432dc212bd7ca8,"agent":n:4018000000000000,"causes":[s:"agent:6",s:"agent:4",],},{"id":n:4059400000000000,"tick":n:40a5ca0000000000,"day":n:405d400000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Ask's hunting bow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:4059800000000000,"tick":n:40a5d80000000000,"day":n:405d400000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Bjorn</b> noticed that grass fibers hold when twisted. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fibersTwist","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:404d45cdba449a79,"y":n:4042d6adbcf49d04,},{"id":n:4059c00000000000,"tick":n:40a5fc0000000000,"day":n:405d800000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Torv's the net. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:405a000000000000,"tick":n:40a6480000000000,"day":n:405e000000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405a400000000000,"tick":n:40a6900000000000,"day":n:405e400000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ask the Spearmaker</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:4051000000000000,"y":n:4044000000000000,},{"id":n:405a800000000000,"tick":n:40a7300000000000,"day":n:405f000000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Ask the Spearmaker</b> brings in the harvest from Ask's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:4051000000000000,"y":n:4044000000000000,},{"id":n:405ac00000000000,"tick":n:40a7680000000000,"day":n:405f800000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405b000000000000,"tick":n:40a8880000000000,"day":n:4060800000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the 