1c00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Vera</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4037000000000000,},{"id":n:407c400000000000,"tick":n:40c3f68000000000,"day":n:407ab00000000000,"year":n:4051c00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Nanna</b> taught <b>Disa</b> the secret of Ask's edge. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:407c500000000000,"tick":n:40c3fa0000000000,"day":n:407ab00000000000,"year":n:4052000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Selma</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4039000000000000,"x":n:404a032264891cae,"y":n:403714eb8f13f5d7,},{"id":n:407c600000000000,"tick":n:40c3fe0000000000,"day":n:407ab00000000000,"year":n:4052000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Vera</b> built a hut.","x":n:404efd179f6cef4e,"y":n:4048e4f7032c37bb,},{"id":n:407c700000000000,"tick":n:40c3fe8000000000,"day":n:407ab00000000000,"year":n:4052000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Vidar</b> began burning a twig at an old tree — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Burning a twig at an old tree)</i>","custom":s:"c6","agent":n:4030000000000000,"x":n:405042dd9f7b4b2a,"y":n:404962c65ef61c7f,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:407c800000000000,"tick":n:40c3fe8000000000,"day":n:407ab00000000000,"year":n:4052000000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Vidar</b> does it differently: burning a twig at an old tree instead of pouring water over the newborn's doorstep. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c6",},{"id":n:407c900000000000,"tick":n:40c4010000000000,"day":n:407ac00000000000,"year":n:4052000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Otto</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4038000000000000,},{"id":n:407ca00000000000,"tick":n:40c40d8000000000,"day":n:407ad00000000000,"year":n:4052000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Vera</b> and <b>Vidar</b> have had a child, <b>Sten II</b> — generation 5. They inherit tra