",],},{"id":n:4089300000000000,"tick":n:40ca498000000000,"day":n:4081900000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ronja II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4048800000000000,"x":n:404aa12faad7bbfb,"y":n:403656a55ae1d08b,},{"id":n:4089380000000000,"tick":n:40ca560000000000,"day":n:4081980000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Alve II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4048000000000000,},{"id":n:4089400000000000,"tick":n:40ca5e8000000000,"day":n:4081980000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga II</b> taught <b>Disa II</b> the secret of Ask's shelter. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:4089480000000000,"tick":n:40ca5f0000000000,"day":n:4081980000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Torv's furnace. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:4089500000000000,"tick":n:40ca618000000000,"day":n:4081a00000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ronja II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4048800000000000,},{"id":n:4089580000000000,"tick":n:40ca620000000000,"day":n:4081a00000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Ylva</b> died of old age at 83. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404cfa6265c3c41b,"y":n:4045c89f8bc19f46,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:4089600000000000,"tick":n:40ca620000000000,"day":n:4081a00000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Ylva is gone. But someone still always takes the long way home. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:401c000000000000,},{"id":n:4089680000000000,"tick":n:40ca620000000000,"day":n:4081a00000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Otto painting a mark on the grave until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c11",},{"id":n:4089700000000000,"tick":n:40ca620000000000,"day":n:4081a00000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Laying flowers on the hut wall anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c12",},{"id":n:4089780000000000,"tick":n:40ca620000000000,"day":n:4081a00000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:4089800000000000,"tick":n:40ca6b8000000000,"day":n:4081a00000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Disa</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:403d000000000000,},{"id":n:4089880000000000,"tick":n:40ca6d0000000000,"day":n:4081a80000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Loke</b> and <b>Liv II</b> have had a child, <b>Signe II</b> — generation 6. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4052c00000000000,"x":n:4047310750e7b6ee,"y":n:4031dcf7a76d2117,"causes":[s:"agent:22",s:"agent:35",],},{"id":n:4089900000000000,"tick":n:40ca6d0000000000,"day":n:4081a80000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"imitated","txt":s:"<b>Ask II</b> has begun laying flowers on the grave, the way Vidar II does. The custom spreads.","custom":s:"c5",},{"id":n:4089980000000000,"tick":n:40ca700000000000,"day":n:4081a80000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Ormstead, believing a great herd walks the night sky, and the living must follow its path is now simply what one does. <b>the Sky-Wheel</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c3","x":n:404d2dda9f6f9e32,"y":n:4045f6c4edc018ee,},{"id":n:4089a00000000000,"tick":n:40ca700000000000,"day":n:4081a80000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Ormstead, believing the world 