a II</b> taught <b>Otto II</b> the secret of Ask's shelter. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:408dd80000000000,"tick":n:40cee20000000000,"day":n:4084a00000000000,"year":n:405b800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:408de00000000000,"tick":n:40ceea8000000000,"day":n:4084a00000000000,"year":n:405b800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Selma II</b> taught <b>Otto II</b> the secret of Torv's furnace. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:408de80000000000,"tick":n:40cef00000000000,"day":n:4084a80000000000,"year":n:405bc00000000000,"type":s:"reformation","txt":s:"⚡ In Ormstead, the old way is set aside: <b>Placing a stone on the grave</b> replaces Laying flowers on the grave. The elders mutter; the young do not listen.","custom":s:"c15","from":s:"c5","x":n:404d2dda9f6f9e32,"y":n:4045f6c4edc018ee,},{"id":n:408df00000000000,"tick":n:40cef00000000000,"day":n:4084a80000000000,"year":n:405bc00000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Nannaholm, laying flowers on the grave is now simply what one does. <b>Laying flowers on the grave</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c5","x":n:4049ee7373446e0c,"y":n:4035a4099c70b519,},{"id":n:408df80000000000,"tick":n:40cef00000000000,"day":n:4084a80000000000,"year":n:405bc00000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🟤 In <b>Ormstead</b>, the guild has mastered <b>Copper</b> — the city itself has learned.","tech":s:"copper","x":n:404d2dda9f6f9e32,"y":n:4045f6c4edc018ee,},{"id":n:408e000000000000,"tick":n:40cf048000000000,"day":n:4084b00000000000,"year":n:405bc00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> taught <b>Selma II</b> the secret of Torv's lenswork. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"glass",},{"id":n:408e080000000000,"tick":n:40cf1c8000000000,"day":n:4084c00000000000,"year":n:405bc00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Vera II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4054c0000