rick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:4094340000000000,"tick":n:40d9b48000000000,"day":n:4091280000000000,"year":n:4066e00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II</b> taught <b>Liv II</b> the secret of Torv's memory-marks. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:4094380000000000,"tick":n:40d9b50000000000,"day":n:4091280000000000,"year":n:4066e00000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40943c0000000000,"tick":n:40d9bc0000000000,"day":n:40912c0000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4094400000000000,"tick":n:40d9c2c000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧠 <b>Ylva II</b> asked not what the world is but why, and wrote it down — <b>Ylva II's the question</b> (Philosophy) has been invented! <i>Reasoned thought — the seed of law, science and doubt.</i>","tech":s:"philosophy","agent":n:4058400000000000,"x":n:404a2b10e1514f65,"y":n:402f840df8b11d43,"causes":[s:"ev:68",],},{"id":n:4094440000000000,"tick":n:40d9c30000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> died of old age at 82. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4055000000000000,"x":n:404a951bced9d589,"y":n:4030ca280bfdaa29,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:4094480000000000,"tick":n:40d9c30000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"conversion","txt":s:"<b>Embla II</b> has left Laying flowers on the grave for Pouring water over the grave. Minds change; so do worlds.","custom":s:"c8","from":s:"c5",},{"id":n:40944c0000000000,"tick":n:40d9c30000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"customBack","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Embla II</b> has revived Pouring water over the grave — an old way returns.","custom":s:"c8",},{"id":n:4094500000000000,"tick":n:40d9c30000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Otto II is gone. But someone still names things that need no names. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:4055000000000000,},{"id":n:4094540000000000,"tick":n:40d9c30000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Ask II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:4094580000000000,"tick":n:40d9c30000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Burning a twig at a flat stone anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c19",},{"id":n:40945c0000000000,"tick":n:40d9c58000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Liv II</b> and <b>Orm II</b> have had a child, <b>Idun II</b> — generation 9. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4059c00000000000,"x":n:404a8ef5422e01bf,"y":n:4031c9f1a0a06555,"causes":[s:"agent:95",s:"agent:90",],},{"id":n:4094600000000000,"tick":n:40d9c58000000000,"day":n:4091300000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎼 <b>Ylva II</b> wrote music down so a song could outlive its singer — <b>Ylva II's written music</b> (Composition) has been invented! <i>Music made lasting and grand — the composer, the choir, the hall.</i>","tech":s:"composition","agent":n:4058400000000000,"x":n:404a54c71b9d4f65,"y":n:4030af0d15d3c1d5,"causes":[s:"ev:37",s:"ev:68",],},{"id":n:4094640000000000,"tick":n:40d9d78000000000,"day":n:40913c0000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Sten II</b> and <b>Ask II</b> have had a child, <b>Halvar II</b> — generation 9. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:405a000000000000,"x":n:404a0674e6c2f4d1,"y":n:4035c1185ab3cec0,"causes":[s:"agent:96",s:"agent:92",],},{"id":n:4094680000000000,"tick":n:40d9d90000000000,"day":n:4091400000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40946c0000000000,"tick":n:40d9dd8000000000,"day":n:4091400000000000,"year":n:4067000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten II</b> taught <b>Halvar II</b> the secret of Ask's edge. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:4094700000000000,"tick":n:40d9e00000000000,"day":n:4091440000000000,"year":n:4067200000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Sten II</b> set out for Ormstead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4058000000000000,"x":n:404bb3ec8551a59e,"y":n:40373a217bf51138,},{"id":n:4094740000000000,"tick":n:40d9e54000000000,"day":n:4091480000000000,"year":n:4067200000000000,"type":s:"trade","txt":s:"🤝 <b>Sten II</b> and <b>Eira II</b> struck a fair trade across village lines.","agent":n:4058000000000000,"x":n:404b858aebfc24ad,"y":n:4038d0288796ffd8,},{"id":n:4094780000000000,"tick":n:40d9ee0000000000,"day":n:40914c0000000000,"year":n:4067200000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Sten II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40947c0000000000,"tick":n:40d9fd0000000000,"day":n:4091580000000000,"year":n:4067200000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4094800000000000,"tick":n:40da024000000000,"day":n:4091580000000000,"year":n:4067200000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Bjorn II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4058800000000000,"x":n:404a51594b676474,"y":n:4031386658963eed,},{"id":n:4094840000000000,"tick":n:40da040000000000,"day":n:40915c0000000000,"year":n:4067400000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4094880000000000,"tick":n:40da040000000000,"day":n:40915c0000000000,"year":n:4067400000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Eira II</b> set out for Ormstead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4056c00000000000,"x":n:404d5048ed464821,"y":n:4038a6e01b9229ea,},{"id":n:40948c00